    "Name": "Eagle EGL-1M",
    "Details": "Produced in 3058 by Curtiss Militech, the <i>Eagle</i> is an effort to create a balanced mix of speed and firepower on a 25-ton chassis. The 1M sports an ER large laser and an ER small laser, along with an anti-missile system. Five jump jets allow it to maintain decent mobility, but its overland speed is lacking compared to similarly weighted BattleMechs.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Extended Torso Twist</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.96</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
